## 6. Entity Catalogue (Sample)
| Entity | Purpose | Primary Key | Relationships |
|--------|---------|-------------|---------------|
| Schools | Represents a school | school_id | One-to-many with campuses |
| Campuses | Physical branches | campus_id | Belongs to school |
| AcademicYears | Defines school year | year_id | One-to-many with terms |
| Terms | Academic terms | term_id | Belongs to academic year |
| Grades | Grade levels | grade_id | One-to-many with classes |
| Classes | Teaching groups | class_id | Belongs to grade |
| Learners | Students | learner_id | Belongs to class |
| Teachers | Educators | teacher_id | Assigned to classes |
| Parents | Parents of learners | parent_id | Linked to learners |
| Attendance | Daily presence | attendance_id | Linked to learners |
| Assessments | Tests and assignments | assessment_id | Linked to subjects |
| Examinations | Formal exams | exam_id | Linked to subjects |
| Fees | School fees | fee_id | Linked to learners |
| Invoices | Billing records | invoice_id | Linked to fees |
| Payments | Transactions | payment_id | Linked to invoices |
| Payroll | Staff salaries | payroll_id | Linked to employees |
| AuditLogs | Compliance tracking | audit_id | Linked to all modules |

